msgstr "Параметры"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:60
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Параметр"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:61
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Значение"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:63
msgid "Colors to Adjust"
msgstr "Цвета для корректировки"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:64
msgid "Selection"
msgstr "Выбор из списка"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:65
msgid "Set which primary and complementary colors are going to be adjusted"
msgstr "Укажите, какие основные и дополнительные цвета будут корректироваться"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:66
msgid "Preserve lightness"
msgstr "Сохранить освещённость"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:67
msgid "Switch"
msgstr "Переключатель"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:68
msgid ""
"Adjusting hues can change lightness\\ [1]_ from original RGB triplet. When "
"enabled, lightness is kept at same value."
msgstr ""
"Корректировка оттенков может изменить освещённость\\ [1]_ исходной тройки "
"RGB. Если включено, освещённость сохраняется на том же значении."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:69
msgid "Hue shift"
msgstr "Смещение оттенка"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:70
msgid "Degrees"
msgstr "Градусы"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:71
msgid "Set the :term:`hue` shift in degrees to apply"
msgstr "Задайте сдвиг :term:`оттенка <Оттенок>` в градусах."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:72
msgid "Saturation shift"
msgstr "Сдвиг насыщенности"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:73
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:76
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:79
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:82
msgid "Float"
msgstr "Дробное"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:74
msgid ""
"Set the :term:`saturation` shift. Allowed range is from -1.000 to 1.000. "
"Default is 0.000."
msgstr ""
"Задайте сдвиг :term:`насыщенности <Насыщенность>`. Допустимый диапазон — от "
"-1.000 до 1.000. По умолчанию — 0.000."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:75
msgid "Intensity shift"
msgstr "Сдвиг интенсивности"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:77
msgid ""
"Set the intensity shift. Allowed range is from -1.000 to 1.000. Default is "
"0.000."
msgstr ""
"Задайте сдвиг интенсивности. Допустимый диапазон — от -1.000 до 1.000. По "
"умолчанию — 0.000."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:78
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "Сила"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:80
msgid ""
"Set the strength of filter. Allowed range is from 0.0 to 100.0. Default is "
"1.0."
msgstr ""
"Задайте силу фильтра. Допустимый диапазон — от 0.0 до 100.0. По умолчанию — "
"1.0."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:81
msgid "Red / Green / Blue weight"
msgstr "Вес красного / зелёного / синего"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/huesaturation.rst:83
msgid ""
"Set weight for each RGB component. This is used in saturation and lightness"
"\\ [1]_ processing."
msgstr ""
"Задаёт вес каждого компонента RGB. Используется при обработке насыщенности и "
"светлоты\\ [1]_."

